<http://example.org/sen0414-ch1617corr-lineage> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "Fresh narrow lineage: SEN0414 Chapters 11, 17 and 16 corrections"@en ;
    owl:versionInfo "1.26.0" ; owl:versionIRI <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1617corr-lineage/1.26.0> ; dcterms:identifier "sen0414_ch1617corr_lineage" ;
    rdfs:comment "1.26.0 (2026-11-20): Urgent interruption declared by the Owner (route 3g(b), recorded before any urgent work). Nothing in this lineage was in progress, so nothing is held; the urgent work lives in its own lineage, sen0414-ch1011simp-lineage 1.0.0. Also corrected: the lineage status had stayed at Opened although its chain stages are done; it is moved to In Progress, as Lineage4 was. Earlier: see 1.25.0."@en .

ex:Lineage10 backlog:hasLineageStatus backlog:LS_InProgress ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Urgency 2026-11-20 17:37 Istanbul: the Owner opened an urgency case on the chapter 10 and 11 slides and code examples. Routed under step 3g(b) of the lineage discipline (read live from GitHub, v163.0.7): declared first, the urgent work in a lineage of its own, built after the declaration. Governing OE rules read from the latest governance ABox: plain talk with the Owner (BP-D63), verify before shipping (L-65), act when the evidence decides (L-78), every named objection gets its own answer (L-113). The chapter 17 page stage (410 of 412 checks, one speed check open) is untouched and waits; the open question on it stays with the Owner." .

<http://example.org/sen0414-ch1617corr-lineage#Urgent_1> a backlog:UrgentInterruption ; rdfs:label "Urgent interruption 1"@en ; backlog:interruptsLineage <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1617corr-lineage#Lineage10> ; backlog:decidedBy backlog:Owner ;
    backlog:urgencyDeclaredAt "2026-11-20T14:40:04Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> ; backlog:urgencyReason "Owner's urgency case of 2026-11-20 17:37: chapter 10 and 11 slides and code examples are unusable in the session; the book's own code, one-piece copyable code and a page that runs every code are needed first." ; backlog:urgencyTimeBoxUntil "2026-11-27T12:00:00Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> ;
    backlog:urgentItem <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1011simp-lineage#ST11_Review_And_Plan> .
